{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c949c131b05ccbbfcf944c99a92fe2e586a1eac2cab7787b746ea94229294330", "ja": "（いよいよ765プロ劇場の初公演が始まるんだけど、\nなぜか真がレッスンルームに行ったまま出てこない…）", "zh": "（765艺能剧场的首次公演就要开始了，\n真进去练习室以后却迟迟没有出来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1001_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "127b190a6decdfaa31473ed1fd31127a9b6f43b5f1190610a5eca131f41c1f84", "ja": "真、そろそろ出番だぞ。\n何かあったのか？", "zh": "真，差不多要上场啰。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "d555c06f7e3ebdca4bcdb7e8956635a0fc53dce02c105e429f31a94efe8fd832", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nすみません。今、片付けが終わったところで……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n不好意思，在下才刚刚收拾完毕而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0ff78ad1012a2b824a79f8697b466ec683eb6dd1cdd75c8fd15af92793d6a78b", "ja": "片付け？　ダンスの確認でもなさそうだけど……\n何をしてたんだ？", "zh": "收拾？看你好像也不是在确认舞步……\n刚刚是在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "2197e7f002a44d4f88e72521aa9efc1257b201f37cf4ce4506e7fcd890950abe", "ja": "新人の子達と一緒に、ストレッチをしてたんです！\nほら、本番前ってガチガチになるじゃないですか？", "zh": "在下刚才在和新人们一起做伸展操！\n你想想，正式上台前不是很容易身体僵硬吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "7131351a75f5c520d9e411cfc452fcae20fac7d9ffcf68e6706fd76272a55a9c", "ja": "だから緊張を少しでもほぐしてあげようと思って。\nそれで、ボクがこの日のために考えてきた……", "zh": "在下希望能多少缓和她们的紧张，\n于是，搬出了在下为今天研发的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "a1e3533f1aef7c23bde8fef11bd5c307c628523b88b9c3cddc9bbedc6187c700", "ja": "『真式プリプリストレッチメソッド』で、\nほぐしてあげてました！", "zh": "『真式软嫩嫩伸展操教学』，\n帮她们好好放松了筋骨一番！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "89e7807c782cb2500ae1e908391f6f4148f3d94f0dba54b71da92dd755737a35", "ja": "プリプリ……？", "zh": "软嫩嫩……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "afa6f2b3aec8e37a8e5e82825d7b4b29ef6d0036c2b454b0b2e280d93b8fece0", "ja": "あ、要はストレッチメニューなんですけどね。\nこれでみんな、万全の状態でステージに立てますよ！", "zh": "啊，总之就是帮助身体放松的伸展操。\n这样大家就能以万全的状态站上舞台了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ef80c6cc52f3f99c27323568b67176918a746ac9a325fcb6292c7a9551edadda", "ja": "なるほど。真も忙しいのに、みんなのために\nそこまで考えてくれたのか。ありがとな。", "zh": "原来如此。你明明自己也很忙，\n还这么替大家着想，谢谢你呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "9c5ff7c182abbf4a57d64ccaccba6e1534d429084fd2c9cb87aa0201786dee4a", "ja": "そんなお礼なんて～。{$P$}がボクに\nしてくれたことを、みんなにしてあげただけですって。", "zh": "不用道谢啦～在下只是将{$P$}\n为在下做的事情同样分享给大家而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "2b25048fa28703fde442a72229097c97e24f6a16d933e7215eadc3608879e536", "ja": "ボクも新人の頃は、よく{$P$}に\n身体とか……いろんな所をほぐしてもらいましたよね？", "zh": "在下还是新人的时候，{$P$}也很常\n帮在下放松身体……按摩各个地方对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "1940db6804cf4cae3e5f5d0c47c1a4dcca8ea2475385299c5ee9ed8050191c88", "ja": "ああいうのって、とってもありがたかったんです。\n身体だけじゃなくて、心も温まるっていうか……。", "zh": "在下当时真的很感谢你的帮忙。\n除了身体之外，感觉心灵也暖和了起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "3cfba4cc13fd21a6952bb69c02d2b020d229fb9751b139b1dd964ae7daf2a77c", "ja": "だから今度は、ボクがみんなにしてあげたいなって\n思って。へへっ！", "zh": "所以这次，就轮到在下来帮大家了，\n嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cac911991683c7b09888765355cd2d47e7abd5417a121aa64bf2d3b64152ffcb", "ja": "（真、本当に頼もしくなったな。\nきっとみんなも真の優しさに感謝してるはずだ）", "zh": "（她是真的越来越可靠了。\n大家一定也很感谢真的好意。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "633d068744d4189913fb35246735bf16c50fd114924a8a44f1711c3fe69cd7eb", "ja": "って、思い出話をしてる場合じゃなかった。\nもうステージの時間ですよねっ？", "zh": "啊，现在不是在这里回忆当年的时候。\n表演的时间已经到了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "870fd706245f59bc374cd231c2ecf0c7c5461be9c802845878b3cabce8ebbf07", "ja": "おっと、そうだった。\nじゃあ、行くか。", "zh": "糟糕，没错。\n我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "451b38bac14cd4ae372417c88b5267691cc8154772d156430681cf0f7f53c86d", "ja": "はいっ！　それじゃ、{$P$}。\nいつものアレ、お願いします！", "zh": "好的！那么，{$P$}，\n麻烦你做平时的那个了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_1019", "source_sha256": "40325c97d227c15ced4bc739bdf8d13a4b5f9608d3f183a193e8ccc0f51bd55b", "ja": "拳を突き出す", "zh": "伸出拳头", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_2000_006mak", "source_sha256": "3ca7c7abcc356e1b5b2408ea27c4d0a929e80aa545b04f934c3a43dded634286", "ja": "ダーン！　へへっ、やーりぃ！\nこれで気合い入りました！", "zh": "碰！嘿嘿，太棒啦！\n这样就有精神了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_2001_006mak", "source_sha256": "70b31c1c2f252f0702098cdd901f8b291a43c97eeb8ef10ecc26f30fd3904cdf", "ja": "{$P$}！\nこの劇場、ボク達みんなで盛り上げていきましょうね！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n就让我们大家一起让这座剧场热闹起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "1ad303aa91d3963b94aabe201ce4ad7899157b5ad01bc71fc460a63c82c0991d", "ja": "（まっすぐで、\nひたむきな真の言葉はとても輝いてる）", "zh": "（个性直率、一心一意朝目标冲刺的真\n说的话是如此动人。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_006mak_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_006mak_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "698371d94a734816fc22cb04c80bb94774e179bbe5a5167c48a65d374601f928", "ja": "（その輝きは、後輩たちの道しるべとなり、\nこの劇場を引っ張っていってくれるはずだ！）", "zh": "（她的光芒肯定会成为新人们前进的路标，\n带领这座剧场前进！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
